message.content:
以下是您需要的四個功能呼叫，請依序執行：

```json
{
  "name": "book_hotel",
  "arguments": {
    "hotel_name": "巴黎布里斯多酒店",
    "location": "Paris, France",
    "room_type": "suite",
    "start_date": "12-01-2022",
    "stay_duration": 10,
    "view": "city view"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "latest_exchange_rate",
  "arguments": {
    "source_currency": "USD",
    "target_currency": "EUR",
    "amount": 1000
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "safeway_order",
  "arguments": {
    "location": "Palo Alto, CA",
    "items": ["water bottle", "apple", "bread"],
    "quantity": [2, 3, 1]
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "light_travel_time",
  "arguments": {
    "distance_in_light_years": 4.24,
    "speed_of_light": 299792458
  }
}
```

執行完上述呼叫後，系統將回傳每個功能的結果，您即可得到：

1. 酒店訂房確認資訊  
2. 1000 美元兌換成歐元的金額  
3. Safeway 訂單的確認與預估送達時間  
4. 從地球到半人馬座次星所需的光速時間（以秒為單位）  

如果您還需要進一步的說明或協助，隨時告訴我！
